    "version": "55.1.0",
    "kind": "struct_field",
    "signature": "parent_filters: Vec<ChildFilterPushdownResult>",
    "docs": "The parent filters that were pushed down as received by the current node when [`ExecutionPlan::gather_filters_for_pushdown`](crate::ExecutionPlan::handle_child_pushdown_result) was called.\nNote that this may *not* be the same as the filters that were passed to the children as the current node may have modified them\n(e.g. by reassigning column indices) when it returned them from [`ExecutionPlan::gather_filters_for_pushdown`](crate::ExecutionPlan::handle_child_pushdown_result) in a [`FilterDescription`].\nAttached to each filter is a [`PushedDown`] *per child* that indicates whether the filter was supported or unsupported by each child.\nTo get combined results see [`ChildFilterPushdownResult::any`] and [`ChildFilterPushdownResult::all`].",
